Body:
@vsixer I did some digging and what I found was this [reddit post](https://www.reddit.com/r/opencodeCLI/comments/1se3tw6/comment/oexkjj3/?context=3).

Seems like the repo description was updated to have some weird crypto hash. The social accounts looked...potentially compromised, too. There was no "bad code" delivered so far as I can tell. That said...even if the author was only briefly compromised that's bad news for a plugin that gets automatically updated every time most people open up their OpenCode session.

NGL, that's a little scary.
